Hi Iabrat,

I’ve never encountered this error before and I’m not sure why. This part of CODEX reuses/depends on the package IRanges and Rsamtools to get coverage. Before getting coverage, did you QC go through? Check ref_qc and see if you have start and end positions. It seems a lot of these are NAs.

Without more codes/outputs, cannot help further :/ Also it seems your problem will be most efficiently addressed by IRanges maintainer. Try google the error messages you can see previous posts.

Yuchao

